@* The "All caught up" empty state (P5-8 / DJ4, extracted plantry-c4qk) — shared verbatim by _ReviewQueue's
   two reachable-empty-queue paths: no flyers at all, and every flyer reviewed (rendered below the rail so
   the done chips/pills stay visible). No model — pure static markup. *@
<div class="card">
    <div class="card__body">
        <div class="empty-state">
            <div class="empty-state__icon">
                <svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-check" /></svg>
            </div>
            <div class="empty-state__title">All caught up</div>
            <div class="empty-state__body">
                No deals waiting on you. New flyer deals that Plantry can&rsquo;t auto-match will show up
                here after the next pull.
            </div>
            <a class="btn btn--secondary" href="/Deals">Back to deals</a>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
